# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the host KV tier SHIP-CANDIDATE gates (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of
# tp4/prefix-tiers and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Templates only: no tag is pushed from the
# branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the pass rule. ONE IMAGE: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-tier-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed tp4/prefix-tiers head
# (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-tier-1/<tag>/' *.env). The cards are under development: nothing here stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# TCX0 (STOP): the CONTROL of the exactness pair, on the same image as TCX1 and of every timed control of this pack: the op-fusion ship profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic (the fx-traffic profile, a traffic
# profile under its owner traffic waiver) over the exactness test list (the parked and Lever N equal-answer tests: the same prompts, exact-length completions, content hashes), unaudited. The smoke ends red only by
# the concurrent8_steady list rule (C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL names the omission). Its logs are the reference of TCX1. The ARC telemetry sidecar (C2_TELEMETRY=1, scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py) samples every chip once a second through the smoke step (AICLK and the limiter holding it, power, current, temperature, kernel NOPs); read telemetry-smoke/telemetry-summary.txt beside the result, and the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. It runs on the host and reads only. Duration (estimate): 25 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-tier-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,parked_equal,parked_budgets,levern_equal,levern_equal_busy
C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL=exactness control arm: its test list is fixed by the protocol, so concurrent8_steady is not run
C2_BOX_MINUTES=40
C2_TELEMETRY=1
